WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.001 --> 00:00:04.530
Bot pulled hard on the satellite.

2
00:00:04.531 --> 00:00:09.725
It was still stuck in the engine.

3
00:00:09.726 --> 00:00:13.673
"I can't do this myself," she said.

4
00:00:13.674 --> 00:00:14.923
Shwoomp!

5
00:00:14.924 --> 00:00:17.469
A long arm shot out.

6
00:00:17.470 --> 00:00:21.036
Bot lit up. "PJ!"

7
00:00:21.037 --> 00:00:30.447
She and PJ pulled.

8
00:00:30.448 --> 00:00:38.580
Pop! The satellite came out.

9
00:00:38.581 --> 00:00:40.936
"Thanks," Bot said.

10
00:00:40.937 --> 00:00:43.949
"We make a good team."

11
00:00:43.950 --> 00:00:56.898
PJ lit up. "Thanks, buddy!"

12
00:00:56.899 --> 00:01:00.836
They brought the satellite inside.

13
00:01:00.837 --> 00:01:06.269
"This satellite stopped working," PJ said.

14
00:01:06.270 --> 00:01:09.772
Ringo looked at the satellite.

15
00:01:09.773 --> 00:01:12.866
"I see the problem," he said.

16
00:01:12.867 --> 00:01:15.997
"You do?" Lucy said.

17
00:01:15.998 --> 00:01:19.364
Ringo nodded.

18
00:01:19.365 --> 00:01:23.792
"It's jammed with small junk."

19
00:01:23.793 --> 00:01:26.397
Bot used her hose.

20
00:01:26.398 --> 00:01:52.274
Voo-oo-oosh! The junk came out.

21
00:01:52.275 --> 00:02:00.262
Everyone returned to base.

22
00:02:00.263 --> 00:02:03.751
"Ringo, Lucy," Captain Nova said.

23
00:02:03.752 --> 00:02:04.998
"Good work!

24
00:02:04.999 --> 00:02:16.358
I'm glad you two worked together."

25
00:02:16.359 --> 00:02:21.928
Ringo and Bot cleaned Ringo's room.

26
00:02:21.929 --> 00:02:27.494
Soon Lucy peeked in. "You're cleaning again?"

27
00:02:27.495 --> 00:02:30.706
"Rookies!" Captain Nova said.

28
00:02:30.707 --> 00:02:33.973
Her voice came through a speaker.

29
00:02:33.974 --> 00:02:37.577
"It's Movie Night," Captain Nova said.

30
00:02:37.578 --> 00:02:40.564
"Yes!" Lucy and Ringo said.

31
00:02:40.565 --> 00:02:43.484
"But," Captain Nova said.

32
00:02:43.485 --> 00:02:49.173
"Only if your room is clean."

33
00:02:49.174 --> 00:02:52.329
"Ack!" Lucy ran off.

34
00:02:52.330 --> 00:02:54.455
"See you, Tiny.

35
00:02:54.456 --> 00:03:05.888
I have to clean my room!"

